  "body": "## What\n\n- Record versioned shell research and probes for Bash 3.2, Bash 5.3, zsh, fish, and GNU/BSD commands.\n- Add shell conventions, worker rules, and decision 0006.\n- Pin ShellCheck 0.11.0 and shfmt 3.14.0, add `check:shell`, `fmt:shell`, and prek hooks, and format the three scripts shfmt identified.\n\n## Why\n\nHooks and agent-image scripts need explicit interpreter and portability rules before implementation.\n\n## Evidence\n\nHarness: Codex CLI 0.157.1. Model: `gpt-6-sol` at high effort.\n\n- [Raw research notes](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/blob/research/30-shell-conventions/research/gates/shell/notes.md) and [versions and source commits](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/blob/research/30-shell-conventions/research/gates/shell/versions.md).\n- `mise run check` passed with temporary cache paths, as did `mise run build` and the full pre-commit and commit-message hook suites.\n- `mise run docs:check-links` built the site but local Mermaid Chromium launch failed under the sandbox, followed by three `/workflow/` link reports in existing pages. The CI docs job passed.\n\n## Docs\n\n- Add the shell conventions guide, `.claude/rules/shell.md`, the AGENTS.md language row, the tooling reference, and decision 0006.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Green CI.\n- [x] Docs updated.\n- [x] No secrets in staged evidence, checked with gitleaks.\n- [x] Evidence committed.\n\nRefs: #30\n",
